                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Williams</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which (2nd time at this Theatre these Seven Years) The Farce of<lb/>
               <bibl><title>The <hi rend="allcaps">Liar</hi>.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Sir James Eliiot,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Betterton,</hi> Jun.</actor></castItem><lb/>
